            "sid": "NEH 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa teina olong negeluni iltung'ana ooitasheiki ilgilat ooshumishoreki, oopiki nkishorunot, o lelo ng'anayio le dukuya, o matuan e tomon, pee eiturrurri tiatua nena ajijik nena rubat pooki naaishiaakino too nkitanapat te nkaraki ilapolosak o Lawi, te risioroto oo nkurman e nena ang'itie; amu etishipe apa Yuda te nkaraki lelo apolosak o Lawi oisiaaishote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
